'''Journey to the West''' (西遊記, ''Saiyūki'', '''Journey to the West''') was a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Starting Money UP (M): Wallet starts with 500¢.

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Journey to the West|Starting Money Up (M)|Kuu, type γ|Kai, type μ|Coppermine, type κ|jpname=西遊記|link=}}
}}

==Trivia==
*This Combo was a reference to the [[wikipedia:Journey to the West|classic Chinese novel]] of the same name. [[Kuu (Uber Rare Cat)|Kuu]], [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Kai]] and [[Coppermine (Uber Rare Cat)|Coppermine]] are modeled after ''Journey to the West'' characters Sun Wukong/Monkey King, Zhu Bajie/Cho Hakkai and Sha Wujing, respectively.

